export const TERMS_OF_USE_MARKDOWN = "# Terms of Use\n\nLast updated: October 27, 2026\n\nThese Terms apply to the Unspoken app (\"Unspoken\", \"the app\"), provided by FOFENSOFT S.R.L., Voluntari, Ilfov, Romania (\"we\", \"us\"). Contact: office@fofensoft.com.\n\nBy using Unspoken you agree to these Terms. Please also read our Privacy Policy, which explains how your data stays on your device.\n\n## 1. What Unspoken is\n\nUnspoken is a private space for writing messages you can't or won't send: to someone in your life, someone you've lost, or someone you've grown apart from. Its purpose is emotional release and self-reflection.\n\nUnspoken is not a messaging service. Nothing you write is ever sent to anyone.\n\n## 2. Not a substitute for professional help\n\nUnspoken is a self-help writing tool. It is not therapy, medical advice, or a medical device, and it does not diagnose or treat any condition.\n\nIf you are struggling, please reach out to a qualified mental health professional. **If you are in crisis or thinking about harming yourself, contact your local emergency number (112 in the EU) or a crisis helpline in your country right away.**\n\n## 3. Your data stays on your device\n\nEverything you write, the names and pictures you add, and your settings are stored only on your device, encrypted. We have no account system, no servers that receive your content, and no analytics. Details are in the Privacy Policy.\n\n## 4. Backups, PIN and data loss\n\n- Your data is encrypted with a key that never leaves the device it was created on. Device backups (iCloud, Google) and moving to a new phone **do not** carry your conversations over.\n- The only way to move or preserve your conversations is a password-protected backup you create from Settings. Keep your backup password safe: we cannot recover it.\n- We cannot recover your PIN. \"Forgot PIN\" erases all data on the device and starts fresh.\n- Uninstalling the app, losing your phone or resetting it permanently erases data that wasn't backed up.\n- Marking a conversation as closed (\"Closure\") is permanent. You can start a new conversation with the same person at any time.\n\nYou are responsible for keeping your device secure and for creating backups if you want to keep your content.\n\n## 5. Acceptable use\n\nUse Unspoken for lawful, personal purposes. Don't attempt to reverse engineer, modify or redistribute the app, except where the law allows it.\n\n## 6. Your content\n\nWhat you write belongs to you. We never see it and claim no rights over it.\n\n## 7. Donations\n\nDonations are voluntary and don't unlock any features. They are handled entirely by Buy Me a Coffee, under its own terms and privacy policy, outside the app. Nothing you write in Unspoken is linked to a donation. Donations are generally non-refundable, except where applicable law gives you a right to a refund.\n\n## 8. Age\n\nYou must be at least 13 years old to use Unspoken. If you are under 18, we encourage you to use it with the awareness of a parent or trusted adult.\n\n## 9. Intellectual property\n\nThe app, its design, name and logo belong to FOFENSOFT S.R.L. These Terms give you a personal, non-transferable licence to use the app on devices you own or control.\n\n## 10. Availability and liability\n\nWe provide Unspoken \"as is\" and may change, update or discontinue it. We work to keep it reliable and secure, but we can't guarantee it will be error-free or that data can never be lost.\n\nTo the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect or consequential losses, for loss of content you didn't back up, or for access to your device by others. Nothing in these Terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law, including liability for intent or gross negligence, or your statutory rights as a consumer.\n\n## 11. App stores\n\nIf you downloaded Unspoken from the Apple App Store, Apple's Standard Licensed Application End User License Agreement also applies. Apple and Google are not parties to these Terms and are not responsible for the app or its support.\n\n## 12. Changes\n\nWe may update these Terms. Material changes will be shown in the app, and the \"Last updated\" date will change. If you keep using the app after a change, the new Terms apply.\n\n## 13. Governing law\n\nThese Terms are governed by Romanian law. If you are a consumer, you keep the protection of the mandatory laws of your country of residence, and you may bring proceedings in the courts there.\n\n## 14. Contact\n\nQuestions or feedback: office@fofensoft.com.\n";

export const PRIVACY_POLICY_MARKDOWN = "# Privacy Policy\n\nLast updated: October 27, 2026\n\nUnspoken is provided by FOFENSOFT S.R.L. (CUI 47274231), Voluntari, Ilfov, Romania. Contact: office@fofensoft.com.\n\n## In short\n\n- Unspoken does not collect, receive or share any of your data.\n- There is no account, no analytics, no advertising and no tracking.\n- Everything stays on your device, encrypted.\n\n## What stays on your device\n\nThe app stores only on your device:\n\n- the names you give to conversations and any pictures you choose for them\n- your messages\n- your settings (such as biometric unlock and auto-delete)\n- a protected (hashed) version of your PIN, never the PIN itself\n\nNone of this is sent to us or to anyone else.\n\n## How it is protected\n\nYour data is encrypted with AES-256. The encryption key is created on your device and kept in the device's secure storage (iOS Keychain / Android Keystore), set so it never leaves that device.\n\nFace ID, Touch ID and fingerprint unlock are handled entirely by your device's operating system. The app only receives a yes/no result and never has access to your biometric data.\n\nWhen the app goes to the background, its content is hidden from the app switcher, and the app locks again after a short time.\n\n## Permissions\n\n- **Contacts** (optional): only used when you choose to pick a person from your contacts. The app reads the name of the contact you select. Your contact list is never uploaded or stored by us. You can use the app without granting this.\n- **Photos** (optional): only used when you choose a picture for a conversation. The selected picture is resized and stored encrypted on your device.\n- **Face ID / biometrics** (optional): used only to unlock the app.\n\nYou can change these permissions at any time in your device settings.\n\n## Backups\n\nYou can export a backup from Settings. The backup file is encrypted with a password you choose, and you decide where to save or share it. We never receive your backups and cannot open them or recover your password.\n\n## Links outside the app\n\nIf you choose to support the app, a Buy Me a Coffee page opens in your browser. That service is governed by its own privacy policy. Nothing from the app is shared with it.\n\n## Information from app stores\n\nIf you have chosen in your device settings to share analytics with app developers, Apple or Google may provide us with anonymous crash reports and aggregate statistics (such as number of installs). These never include your messages, names or pictures.\n\n## Deleting your data\n\nYou can delete individual messages, all messages in a conversation, or whole conversations in the app. \"Forgot PIN\" erases everything. Uninstalling the app removes all its data from your device. Optional auto-delete can remove old messages automatically. If you turn on \"Erase data after 10 failed attempts\", everything is erased after 10 wrong PINs in a row.\n\n## Your rights\n\nBecause we don't collect or hold your personal data, we have nothing to access, correct or delete on our side. You are always in full control of your data on your device. If you have any privacy question, contact us at office@fofensoft.com. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection authority (in Romania: ANSPDCP).\n\n## Children\n\nUnspoken is intended for users aged 13 and older. We do not knowingly collect any data from anyone, including children.\n\n## Changes\n\nIf this policy changes, we'll update the \"Last updated\" date and show material changes in the app.\n\n## Contact\n\nFOFENSOFT S.R.L. · office@fofensoft.com\n";
